não é, igual insinuavam lá na época do lançamento do jogo, do contrário você vai acabar se decepcionando.", "timestamp_created": 1720460564, "timestamp_updated": 1720460564, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.595200836658477783", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "169344894", "author": {"steamid": "76561199229748623", "personaname": "Miw", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/miwzinha/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 2466, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2317, "last_played": 1755211785, "avatar": "205d40ba481ef4a69ef0bad0706507d4abc07612"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Viciante!", "timestamp_created": 1720458064, "timestamp_updated": 1720458064, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169291487", "author": {"steamid": "76561198178246883", "personaname": "Anakin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ab-banagouro/", "num_games_owned": 194, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 1406, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 513, "last_played": 1726965409, "avatar": "8c42bf04674af0a0230e38085223082c5124607f"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Honestamente? É sim um bom sucessor espiritual do Left 4 Dead. O jogo tem gráficos incríveis, jogabilidade bem fluída e traz alguns refrescos, como variedade de personagens, armas e apresentação dos mutantes.\nExiste sim muita semelhança com o L4D, bom pro saudosismo, com um pouco mais de frenesi e dificuldade em algumas partes das campanhas.\nParticularmente não gosto da parte das cartas, com as builds etc. Entendo a necessidade de inovação, mas não me pega rs. \nNão acho que valha no preço cheio. Recomendo esperar uma promoção, já que na essência, o jogo tem objetivos simples.\nUma pena não ter caído no gosto da comunidade, pois entre amigos é uma experiência de jogo bem legal. \n", "timestamp_created": 1720400330, "timestamp_updated": 1720400330, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.570326864719390869", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169288634", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038975274", "personaname": "Marlbixa", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/OGMMAX/", "num_games_owned": 136, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 1188, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 756, "last_played": 1720720349, "avatar": "a52ea8ae0ac62f00b6426865616d0722d787bd41"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Bom", "timestamp_created": 1720397213, "timestamp_updated": 1720397213, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169280491", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119436283", "personaname": "Shadow", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/guis2/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 509, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 111, "last_played": 1731870017, "avatar": "7a117e6c883267d13b5be8c0e730cb4b927e